/ActualText (Studied at Universitas Surabaya \(UBAYA\), where I developed a marketplace application as my thesis project. The application enabled university organizations to sell event tickets while allowing users to browse and purchase tickets directly through the app. It was built using PhoneGap, a cross-platform mobile application framework.)
